# No content, only version limits: pacman rejects a -Syu as a whole if it would raise a coupled
# package above the approved version (no partial upgrade). A conflicts entry does not affect
# packages that are not installed. Each approval is a new version of this package.
# The lists are written by tools/freigabe.py (libraries our packages link against + kern.list),
# each with the version on the mirrors, which must also be the one recorded in the .BUILDINFO of
# our packages (otherwise freigabe.py aborts). Do not edit by hand.
